# Prettier

This project uses Prettier (`prettier` + `prettier-plugin-svelte`).

After creating or modifying source files in this repo, run Prettier on the paths you changed before finishing:

- `bun run format` for a full pass when many files changed
- `bunx prettier --write <paths>` when only a few files changed

Do not hand-format style that Prettier owns (quotes, trailing commas, wrapping). Match existing code by running the formatter.
